<section aria-labelledby="h-copyright" class="help-copyright" id="copyright">
<h2 class="help-copyright__heading-copyright-terms-use" id="h-copyright">Copyright and Terms of Use</h2>
<p class="help-copyright__text">How a collection item can be used varies depending on the conditions of its copyright license, intellectual property or cultural advice. Please check the License type and Terms of Use on individual record for further information.</p>
<ol class="help-copyright__list">
<li class="help-copyright__list-item"><strong class="help-copyright__item-strong">Free Access.</strong> Collection items available to download may be reused for personal, research, educational or non-commercial purposes. Attribution to the creator and acknowledgement of University of Melbourne is requested.</li>
<li class="help-copyright__list-item"><strong class="help-copyright__item-strong">Licensed.</strong> Some collection items are available for use under Creative Commons or other licence types. Please follow the specific licence terms shown on the individual record.</li>
<li class="help-copyright__list-item"><strong class="help-copyright__item-strong">Cultural Conditions.</strong> Where collection items carrying a cultural or advisory notice, engage respectfully with the content. For more information see <a class="help-copyright__item-link-indigenous-cultural-data" href="<%= indigenous_data_path %>">Indigenous Cultural Data and Access</a>.</li>
<li class="help-copyright__list-item"><strong class="help-copyright__item-strong">Contact the Collection</strong> when copyright terms are unclear, or when seeking permission to use collection items in publications, online, and commercial use. To assist in the query, note the information in Cite this item and prepare a description of your intended use.</li>
<li class="help-copyright__list-item"><strong class="help-copyright__item-strong">University Copyright Office.</strong> To learn more about copyright and licensing, see the University Copyright Office website, including information on:
      <ul class="help-copyright__item-list">
<li class="help-copyright__list-item">Basic principles of copyright</li>
<li class="help-copyright__list-item">Understanding publishing agreements</li>
<li class="help-copyright__list-item">Licences and contracts</li>
<li class="help-copyright__list-item">Protecting your work</li>
<li class="help-copyright__list-item">Using copyright material</li>
<li class="help-copyright__list-item">Copyright and research</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol></section><aside aria-labelledby="h-contact-box-topic" class="contact-box">
<h2 class="contact-box__title" id="h-contact-box-topic">Still need help?</h2>
<p class="contact-box__text">Contact the collections team. We aim to respond to enquiries within 5 business days.</p>
<a class="contact-box__link" href="<%= contact_path %>">Contact the collections team</a></aside>
